 gumball up a ramp: if you make it to the top the machine gives you two or =
3 pieces of gum instead of just the one! I did poorly, and Nakazawa=E9=95=
=B7=E8=80=81 gave it a whirl. He got the gumball to the top! His gumball we=
nt into a special hole, and out popped- 1 piece of gum =F0=9F=98=82=F0=9F=
=98=82=F0=9F=98=82 All of his meticulous control of the machine and it didn=
&#39;t give him more than he would&#39;ve gotten if his gumball fell off th=
e platform immediately lol. I thought it was hilarious. After that we heade=
d over to the church to wind down and get some food ready for the family ho=
