oesn&#39;t know when to stop talking =F0=9F=98=82. It was a great lesson Wi=
th Him and Nishioka san, but it ended up going until like 10:00 PM =F0=9F=
=98=A2 We need to try and politely address him about how we can try and do =
things more efficiently next time =F0=9F=98=85 All in all, a pretty good Pd=
ay.</div><div dir=3D"auto"><br></div><div dir=3D"auto">August 5th rainy aft=
ernoon =F0=9F=8C=A7</div><div dir=3D"auto"><br></div><div dir=3D"auto">Toda=
y was awesome! I feel like today we made a big step as far as finding time =
(and protecting finding time) goes. We started off the day with DCM, and I =
