nderstanding. I shared about my experiences teaching Nao and Mai with Sonom=
ura=E9=95=B7=E8=80=81, and how it&#39;s important we break things down into=
 manageable chunks depending on the friends level of comprehension. I also =
expressed the importance of our friends=E2=80=99 agency, and how even if we=
 teach perfectly, it&#39;s still up for them to let our message into their =
hearts, and work in them. It was pretty nice. Afterwards we headed out to d=
