t was a really fun Eikaiwa tonight, and Katayama san, Matsuoka San and I ev=
en played some Boggle together! I really love those two. Afterwards Nakazaw=
a=E9=95=B7=E8=80=81 shared a spiritual Message about the importance of pray=
er (It&#39;s super important!!! Every day!!!) And we talked and enjoyed som=
e snacks all together. I told everyone about how I love looking for CDs and=
 got a few tips as to where I might look. All in all, super great day =F0=
=9F=98=8A</div><div dir=3D"auto"><br></div><div dir=3D"auto">August 6th Mos=
tly Cloudy =E2=98=81=EF=B8=8F=F0=9F=8C=A5</div><div dir=3D"auto"><br></div>=
