 I try to see</div><div dir=3D"auto">Your face. But, I can&#39;t.</div><div=
 dir=3D"auto"><br></div><div dir=3D"auto">This next thing isn&#39;t poetry,=
 just an interesting thought I had:</div><div dir=3D"auto">I believe that G=
od has given us our lives and trials as a way to learn and grow and become =
