I love the Morimotos. Morimoto=E5=A7=89=E5=A6=B9 also reminds me of my mom =
so I feel at home in their home =F0=9F=98=81 Kindness and hospitality speak=
 volumes!</div><div dir=3D"auto">Later today due to the rain we were kinda =
